// Sundays only: Pim signs the player up for the derby (southDerby: land a
// Seahorsling on derby day).

## The derby desk

::bg{location="tidewell-pier" time="day"}
::music{action="change" mood="festive" volume="up"}
::auto{character="tidewellPim" anchor="center" action="enter"}
@tidewellPim{code="0010" emotion="happy"}: Welcome, welcome, WELCOME to the Tidewell Sunday Derby! Established one hundred and four years ago by my great-great-grandmother, who was very bored!
@tidewellPim{code="0020"}: The rules: one rod, one day, one fish. This week's prize fish is the Seahorsling. Land one before midnight and the trophy's yours.
@tidewellPim{code="0030" emotion="surprised"}: No Seahorsling? Nobody ever gets a Seahorsling. That's why it's the prize. Good luck!
::accept{quest="southDerby"}
